---
import { experienceGroups, projects, stackGroups } from '../data/portfolio';
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const navigation = [
  { id: 'proyectos', label: 'Proyectos' },
  { id: 'experiencia', label: 'Experiencia' },
  { id: 'sobre-mi', label: 'Sobre mí' },
  { id: 'contacto', label: 'Contacto' },
];

const portrait = '/images/jesus-chacon.png';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Jesús Chacón Ávila · Tech Lead y Full Stack Developer"
  description="Porfolio de Jesús Chacón Ávila, Tech Lead y desarrollador full stack en Málaga. Proyectos, experiencia y contacto."
>
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-line bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm">
      <nav class="page-container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2 py-3 sm:min-h-14 sm:py-2" aria-label="Navegación principal">
        <a href="#inicio" class="font-heading text-lg font-bold" aria-label="Jesús Chacón Ávila, inicio">JC<span class="text-teal-ink">.</span></a>
        <ul class="flex w-full flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs font-semibold text-muted sm:w-auto sm:gap-x-8 sm:text-sm">
          {navigation.map(({ id, label }) => (
            <li><a class="inline-block py-1 hover:text-teal-ink" href={`#${id}`}>{label}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="contenido" class="scroll-mt-24" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="page-container grid items-center gap-10 pt-14 pb-16 sm:pt-20 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,16rem)] md:gap-10 md:pt-32 md:pb-24" aria-labelledby="home-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-apricot-pale px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold">Málaga, España</p>
          <h1 id="home-heading" class="mt-6 text-4xl leading-[1.08] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Jesús Chacón Ávila</h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold text-teal-ink sm:text-2xl">Tech Lead / Full Stack Developer</p>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
            Combino arquitectura, ejecución técnica y gestión de equipos para convertir ideas en productos digitales que evolucionan con rapidez y calidad.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a class="action action-primary" href="#contacto">Hablemos <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="action" href="#proyectos">Ver proyectos</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figure class="w-full max-w-56 rounded-[2.25rem] border border-line bg-mist/60 p-2.5 shadow-xl shadow-teal-ink/10 md:max-w-none">
          <img src={portrait} alt="Retrato de Jesús Chacón Ávila" width="400" height="400" fetchpriority="high" class="aspect-square w-full rounded-[1.75rem] object-cover" />
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section id="proyectos" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-mist py-16 md:scroll-mt-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
        <div class="page-container">
          <h2 id="projects-heading" class="section-heading">Proyectos destacados</h2>
          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
            {projects.map(({ slug, name, role, period, label, description, highlights, stack }) => (
              <article class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-7">
                {label && <p class="mb-3 self-start rounded-full bg-apricot-pale px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-bold">{label}</p>}
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2">
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">{name}</h3>
                  {period && <p class="text-xs font-bold whitespace-nowrap text-muted">{period}</p>}
                </div>
                {role && <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-teal-ink">{role}</p>}
                <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">{description}</p>
                {highlights && (
                  <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted marker:text-teal-ink">
                    {highlights.map((highlight) => <li>{highlight}</li>)}
                  </ul>
                )}
                <ul class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-5" aria-label={`Tecnologías de ${name}`}>
                  {Array.from(new Set(stack.flatMap(({ items }) => items))).map((technology) => <li class="tag">{technology}</li>)}
                </ul>
                <a class="mt-5 self-start font-bold text-teal-ink underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href={`/proyectos/${slug}`}>
                  Ver proyecto<span class="sr-only">: {name}</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="experiencia" class="page-container scroll-mt-24 py-16 md:scroll-mt-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
        <h2 id="experience-heading" class="section-heading">Experiencia y stack</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.35fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]">
          <div class="space-y-8">
            {experienceGroups.map(({ title, entries }) => (
              <div>
                <h3 class={title ? 'mb-4 text-sm font-semibold text-teal-ink' : 'sr-only'}>{title ?? 'Trayectoria profesional'}</h3>
                <ul class="space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-5">
                  {entries.map(({ company, role, period, description }) => (
                    <li class="relative before:absolute before:top-1.5 before:-left-6 before:size-2.5 before:rounded-full before:bg-teal-ink">
                      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-muted">{period}</p>
                      <h4 class="mt-1 font-heading text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed sm:text-base">
                        {company} <span class="text-teal-ink">· {role}</span>
                      </h4>
                      <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{description}</p>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3">
            {stackGroups.map(({ title, items }) => (
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-line px-5 py-4">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">{title}</h3>
                <ul class="mt-2.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  {items.map((item) => <li class="tag">{item}</li>)}
                </ul>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="sobre-mi" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-mist py-16 md:scroll-mt-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
        <div class="page-container grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_15rem] md:gap-16">
          <div>
            <h2 id="about-heading" class="section-heading">Sobre mí</h2>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-muted">
              <p>Soy Tech Lead y desarrollador full stack con más de diez años en el ecosistema JavaScript. Disfruto convirtiendo ideas en funcionalidades y trabajando cerca de los equipos de producto y diseño.</p>
              <p>Combino IA aplicada al desarrollo con prácticas de Extreme Programming, pair programming, TDD y arquitectura hexagonal o en capas para construir software que el equipo pueda mantener y hacer crecer.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-7 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-white p-4">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Formación</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold">Ingeniería Informática</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted">Universidad de Málaga · 2011–2015</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-white p-4">
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Idiomas</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Español · Nativo</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Inglés · B1 (preparando B2)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <img src={portrait} alt="" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" class="aspect-square w-full max-w-48 rounded-[1.75rem] border border-line object-cover md:max-w-none" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contacto" class="page-container scroll-mt-24 py-16 text-center md:scroll-mt-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-heading">¿Tienes un producto que impulsar?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-md leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Estoy abierto a nuevos retos de liderazgo técnico y desarrollo full stack. Escríbeme y lo hablamos.
        </p>
        <a class="action action-primary mt-6" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jesuschacon/">Contactar en LinkedIn</a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="border-t border-line px-6 py-7 text-center text-sm text-muted">
      © {new Date().getFullYear()} Jesús Chacón Ávila · Málaga
    </footer>
</SiteLayout>
